title: Education Policy
subtitle: Education: village schools, courses for adults, a secular school.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_education.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'education_program') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.education_program (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.10). Opening and closing the card are
// free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card. Z — 0.97 (the
// sketch of 7 XI 2026): two sentences on top and one gain and one cost per option.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'education_program');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_education');
!}

= Education policy

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Primary school is compulsory, but the villages lack schools and many adult workers cannot read. Each programme covers one of three parts of the country.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[? if pl_gc_projects : [+ pl_gc_projects +] ?]

- @rural_access
- @urban_worker_adult_access
- @secular
- @delay_schools
- @nothing
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@rural_access
title: Build schools in the villages
subtitle: Cost: [+ pl_cost2 +]. The peasants trust PPS more (+4).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'education_program', 'rural_access').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_education_program_rural_access_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'education_program', 'rural_access');
!}
go-to: result

@urban_worker_adult_access
title: Open courses for adults in the workers’ centres
subtitle: Cost: [+ pl_cost2 +]. The workers trust PPS more (+4).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'education_program', 'urban_worker_adult_access').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_education_program_urban_worker_adult_access_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'education_program', 'urban_worker_adult_access');
!}
go-to: result

@secular
title: Introduce the secular school
subtitle: Cost: [+ pl_cost2 +]. Workers and the intelligentsia trust PPS more (+4), but the Christian Democrats and the Church protest, and our relations with the Christian Democrats worsen (−8). [? if pl_education_program_secular_coalition : [+ pl_education_program_secular_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'education_program', 'secular').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_education_program_secular_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'education_program', 'secular');
!}
go-to: result

@delay_schools
title: Postpone the building of schools
subtitle: The budget gains 1 unit at once. The teachers and the intelligentsia trust PPS less (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'education_program', 'delay_schools').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_education_program_delay_schools_why +]
on-arrival: {!
// Z — 1.11 (decisions 5A and 2A of 8 XI 2026): the saving of this ministry, +1 B with its political cost.
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'education_program', 'delay_schools');
!}
go-to: result

@nothing
title: Do nothing now
subtitle: The card is played and comes back in three months.
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.skipCard(Q);
!}
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= Education policy

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
